{"code":"sw-KE","name":"Swahili","native":"Kiswahili","variant":"Kenya","badge":"SW","tts":"sw-KE","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Sielewi.","say":"see-eh-LEH-wee","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Sijui.","say":"see-JOO-ee","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Subiri kidogo, tafadhali.","say":"soo-BEE-ree kee-DOH-goh, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Rudia, tafadhali.","say":"roo-DEE-ah, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"Please say it again.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Polepole, tafadhali.","say":"poh-leh-POH-leh, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak","hook":"Polepole (slowly) is half the Swahili attitude to life."},{"id":"c1.6","t":"“…” kwa Kiswahili ni nini?","say":"… kwah kee-swah-HEE-lee nee NEE-nee","en":"What’s “…” in Swahili?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Sawa.","say":"SAH-wah","en":"OK. / Sure.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Hasa.","say":"HAH-sah","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Nadhani hivyo.","say":"nah-DHAH-nee HEE-vyoh","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Kweli?","say":"KWEH-lee","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Hakuna shida.","say":"hah-KOO-nah SHEE-dah","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Safi!","say":"SAH-fee","en":"Great! / Cool!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x} iko wapi?","say":"{x} EE-koh WAH-pee","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"],"note":"everyday Kenyan Swahili uses iko for everything"},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Nataka {x}.","say":"nah-TAH-kah {x}","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Kuna {x}?","say":"KOO-nah {x}","en":"Is there {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, tafadhali.","say":"{x}, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Lazima {x}.","say":"lah-ZEE-mah {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Naweza kuingia?","say":"nah-WEH-zah koo-een-GEE-ah","en":"Can I come in?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Nitaangalia.","say":"nee-tah-ahn-gah-LEE-ah","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Nina mkutano.","say":"NEE-nah m-koo-TAH-noh","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Ina pilipili?","say":"EE-nah pee-lee-PEE-lee","en":"Is it spicy? (lit. has it chili?)","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Bila kitunguu, tafadhali.","say":"BEE-lah kee-toon-GOO, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Unapendekeza nini?","say":"oo-nah-pen-deh-KEH-zah NEE-nee","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Sili nyama.","say":"SEE-lee NYAH-mah","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Bei gani?","say":"bay GAH-nee","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Naangalia tu.","say":"nah-ahn-gah-LEE-ah too","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Nitachukua.","say":"nee-tah-choo-KOO-ah","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Naweza kulipa kwa kadi?","say":"nah-WEH-zah koo-LEE-pah kwah KAH-dee","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Ni mbali?","say":"nee m-BAH-lee","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Uwanja wa ndege, tafadhali.","say":"oo-WAHN-jah wah n-DEH-geh, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"kushoto · kulia · moja kwa moja","say":"koo-SHOH-toh · koo-LEE-ah · MOH-jah kwah MOH-jah","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Msaada!","say":"m-sah-AH-dah","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Hakuna karatasi ya chooni.","say":"hah-KOO-nah kah-rah-TAH-see yah choh-OH-nee","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Najisikia vibaya.","say":"nah-jee-see-KEE-ah vee-BAH-yah","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Ita ambulensi, tafadhali.","say":"EE-tah ahm-boo-LEN-see, tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Nafurahi kukutana nawe.","say":"nah-foo-RAH-hee koo-koo-TAH-nah NAH-weh","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Unatoka wapi?","say":"oo-nah-TOH-kah WAH-pee","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Unafanya kazi gani?","say":"oo-nah-FAH-nyah KAH-zee GAH-nee","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Ni tamu sana!","say":"nee TAH-moo SAH-nah","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Jambo.","say":"JAHM-boh","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Habari za asubuhi.","say":"hah-BAH-ree zah ah-soo-BOO-hee","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Habari yako?","say":"hah-BAH-ree YAH-koh","en":"How are you? (answer: Nzuri, “good”)"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ndiyo. · Hapana.","say":"n-DEE-yoh · hah-PAH-nah","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Tafadhali.","say":"tah-fah-DHAH-lee","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Asante.","say":"ah-SAHN-teh","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Samahani.","say":"sah-mah-HAH-nee","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Kwaheri.","say":"kwah-HEH-ree","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"moja · mbili · tatu","say":"MOH-jah · m-BEE-lee · TAH-too","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"nne · tano · sita","say":"n-NEH · TAH-noh · SEE-tah","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"saba · nane · tisa","say":"SAH-bah · NAH-neh · TEE-sah","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"kumi · ishirini · mia","say":"KOO-mee · ee-shee-REE-nee · MEE-ah","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Tufaha ni jekundu.","say":"too-FAH-hah nee jeh-KOON-doo","en":"The apple is red.","note":"ni = is · adjectives take a prefix that matches the noun"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Ninakula tufaha.","say":"nee-nah-KOO-lah too-FAH-hah","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"ni- (I) + -na- (now) + kula (eat): one word"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Nilikula tufaha.","say":"nee-lee-KOO-lah too-FAH-hah","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"-li- = past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Nataka kula tufaha.","say":"nah-TAH-kah KOO-lah too-FAH-hah","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"nataka + ku- verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Unakula matufaha?","say":"oo-nah-KOO-lah mah-too-FAH-hah","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"u- = you · the voice goes up"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"choo","say":"CHOH-oh","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"duka la dawa","say":"DOO-kah lah DAH-wah","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"hospitali","say":"hos-pee-TAH-lee","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"kituo","say":"kee-TOO-oh","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"uwanja wa ndege","say":"oo-WAHN-jah wah n-DEH-geh","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hoteli","say":"hoh-TEH-lee","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"maji","say":"MAH-jee","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"kahawa","say":"kah-HAH-wah","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"bili","say":"BEE-lee","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"menyu","say":"MEH-nyoo","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"bia","say":"BEE-ah","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"hii","say":"HEE-ee","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"mfuko","say":"m-FOO-koh","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"mkutano","say":"m-koo-TAH-noh","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"faili","say":"fah-EE-lee","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"skrini","say":"SKREE-nee","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"ujumbe","say":"oo-JOOM-beh","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"kesho","say":"KEH-shoh","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"niende","say":"nee-EN-deh","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"niingie","say":"nee-EEN-gee-eh","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"nilipe","say":"nee-LEE-peh","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Mzio · tafadhali soma","ask":"Je, chakula hiki kina chochote kati ya hivi?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Asante sana!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Nina mzio mkali wa karanga. Siwezi kula karanga wala mafuta ya karanga.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Nina mzio mkali wa samaki wa magamba (kamba, kaa, chaza).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Siwezi kula gluteni (ngano, shayiri).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Mimi ni mlaji mboga. Sili nyama, kuku wala samaki.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Sili nguruwe.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"CHOO · MSALANI","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"WANAUME · WANAWAKE","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"TOKA · INGIA","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"SUKUMA · VUTA","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"NJIA YA DHARURA","en":"Emergency exit"}]}